      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound creative block, which can feel incredibly isolating and overwhelming. Please know that this feeling, while intense, is a common part of the creative process, and it doesn't define your entire worth or potential. Sometimes, stepping away from the pressure of \"making it\" and just letting yourself explore without expectation can help unlock new pathways. Be gentle with yourself during this time; recovery from creative burnout takes patience.",
